g kepada bisikan itu, mereka merasa senang kepadanya dan supaya mereka mengerjakan apa yang mereka (syaitan) kerjakan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلِتَصْغَىٰٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَيْهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَفْـِٔدَةُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِٱلْءَاخِرَةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلِيَرْضَوْهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلِيَقْتَرِفُوا۟", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/4a4d9aa3e6bb69404fd2.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i da počine", "en": "and that they may commit", "tr": "ve işlesinler", "fr": "et afin qu'ils commettent", "id": "dan agar mereka mengerjakan", "ur": "اور تاکہ وہ گناہ کریں", "bn": "এবং যেন তারা উপার্জন করে", "fa": "و تا مرتکب (گناه) شوند"}}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّقْتَرِفُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "وَلِيَقْتَرِفُوا۟", "count": 1, "first": "6:113", "audio": "audio/4a4d9aa3e6bb69404fd2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "subjunctive"}], "gloss": {"bs": "i da počine", "en": "and that they may commit", "tr": "ve işlesinler diye", "fr": "et qu'ils commettent", "id": "dan agar mereka berbuat", "ur": "اور تاکہ وہ کریں", "bn": "এবং যাতে তারা করে", "fa": "و انجام دهند"}}, {"arabic": "يَقْتَرِفُونَ", "count": 1, "first": "6:120", "audio": "audio/033d3cda5e47ed606133.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "they commit (a sin)", "bs": "čine", "tr": "işlerl